s/figure-html/allelic frequency-1.png){width=960}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n**Interpretation:** Each point represents a variant's allelic frequency. The diamond markers indicate the median allelic frequency for each consequence type. Allelic frequency represents the proportion of DNA reads containing the variant allele.\n\n### By Gene\n\nMutation landscape showing allelic frequency distribution across the most frequently mutated genes.\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](variant_occ_files/figure-html/gene landscape-1.png){width=1344}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n**Interpretation:** Each point represents a variant in a specific gene. Box plots show the distribution (median, quartiles, and range) of allelic frequencies for the top 15 most frequently mutated genes. Red diamond markers highlight the median allelic frequency per gene. Genes are ordered by median allelic frequency.\n\n:::\n\n## Thoracic Tumor Board Patient {.tabset}\n\nThis section focuses on the patients with both thoracic cancer diagnoses and tumor board presentations who have genomic variant data. These patients represent a high-complexity cohort requiring multidisciplinary care.\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n\n::: {.panel-tabset}\n\n### Gene Mutations\n\nTop genes mutated in thoracic tumor board patients.\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-50fdff1d45bdd6ca982b\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-50fdff1d45bdd6ca982b\">{\"x\":{\"visdat\":{\"82b71aaa899\":[\"function () \",\"plotlyVisDat\"]},\"cur_data\":\"82b71aaa899\",\"attrs\":{\"82b71aaa899\":{\"x\":{},\"y\":{},\"z\":{},\"colorscale\":[[\"0\",\"#f3f0f7\"],[\"0.5\",\"#bebada\"],[\"1\",\"#6a4c93\"]],\"hovertemplate\":\"<b>%{y}<\\/b><br> %{x}: %{z}<br> <extra><\\/extra>\",\"showscale\":true,\"colorbar\":{\"title\":\"Count\"},\"alpha_stroke\":1,\"sizes\":[10,100],\"spans\":[1,20],\"type\":\"